            "parentRepo": null,
            "forks": 0,
            "dateModified": "739722",
            "ranking": 1.2,
            "searchField": "fillet_in_bbox alzatin purpose: a parametric tool that applies filleted edges to a 3d shape with optional spatial constraint.\n\nwhat it does:\n\ntakes a shape and applies a fillet (rounded edge) operation to it\noptionally constrains the filleting to only edges within a specified bounding box region\nif no region is specified, it fillets all edges on the shape\nreturns the filleted geometry\n\ninputs:\n\nshapetofillet (geometry): the 3d shape to apply fillets to\nregionshape (geometry, optional): a reference shape used to define a bounding box - only edges within this box will be filleted\nradius (number, default: 2): the radius of the fillet/rounded edge\n abundance-tool",
            "owner": "alzatin",
            "description": "Purpose: A parametric tool that applies filleted edges to a 3D shape with optional spatial constraint.\n\nWhat it does:\n\nTakes a shape and applies a fillet (rounded edge) operation to it\nOptionally constrains the filleting to only edges within a specified bounding box region\nIf no region is specified, it fillets all edges on the shape\nReturns the filleted geometry\n\nInputs:\n\nShapeToFillet (geometry): The 3D shape to apply fillets to\nRegionShape (geometry, optional): A reference shape used to define a bounding box - only edges within this box will be filleted\nRadius (number, default: 2): The radius of the fillet/rounded edge\n",
            "contentURL": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alzatin/fillet_in_BBox/master/project.abundance?sanitize=true",
            "svgURL": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alzatin/fillet_in_BBox/master/project.svg?sanitize=true",
            "isLocal": false
          },
